        "text": "So:\n\n64^2 ÷ 8^3\n= (2^6)^2 ÷ (2^3)^3\n= 2^12 ÷ 2^9\n= 2^3 = 8\n\nCommon base first. Exponent laws second.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
